	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non dubito, quin nostrum accęperis responsum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Gemeint ist wohl die nicht erhaltene Antwort der Pfarrer von <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> auf die Briefe von <persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName> (oben <ref target="file10538">Nr. 502</ref>) und <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> (oben <ref target="file10540">Nr. 504</ref>).</note>, charissime <persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName>, sed quam gratum vobis futurum sit, nescio.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Perpetuo tamen <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>spero animos nostros nihil dissituros [!], dum nos mutuo et coram recte intellexerimus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego hoc in negocio <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>deprehendo <persName ref="p8310">Chelium</persName> minus ęquum; nam <placeName ref="l760">Salodori</placeName> plerique suggerunt plebi omnes civitates <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName> accessisse, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>soli <placeName ref="l41">Bernatium</placeName> asini et dromones<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Wörtlich: Schnellsegler; hier wohl Spottname im Sinne von: Schlafmützen (vgl. Lexicon Latinitatis Nederlandicae medii aevi, Bd. III, hg. v. Olga Weijers u. Marijke Gumbert-Hepp, Leiden 1986, S. 1603).</note> sua sententia, quam etiam nusquam firmare possint, pertinaciter perstent.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">At unde credis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>hoc murmur enatum, nisi quod is - alioqui <persName ref="p4620">Gallorum legato</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p4620">Louis Daugerant, Seigneur de Boisrigaut</persName>.</note>, mastygi nostro, gratus - retulerit?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Apud me nec verbo <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>de negocio mentionem fęcit, sed apud alios vereor ne nos omnes traducat, quod ab initio Luteranus fuerit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Sed quid hęc, inutilia scilicet et vana.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Aliud scribam tibi uni ea fide, qua non solum te mihi, sed et iis, quos <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>te totum aliquando desiderasse non ignoras, iam dudum credidisti.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Admonitus sum hac rerum nostrarum cum <placeName ref="l167">Gebennensibus</placeName> tempestate <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sic futurum, si quorundam consiliis prospere succedit, ut et ab <placeName ref="l2478">Allobrogibus</placeName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><placeName ref="l2478">Savoyen</placeName>.</note> aut <persName ref="p18300">infulato</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p18300">Pierre de la Baume</persName>, Bischof von <placeName ref="l167">Genf</placeName>.</note> <placeName ref="l167">Geneva</placeName> occupetur et deinde nigri <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et albi<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><placeName ref="l160">Freiburg</placeName>; <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> spielt auf die Wappenfarben an.</note>, nobis vicini consortio et auxilio, <placeName ref="l1068">Moretum</placeName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><placeName ref="l1068">Murten</placeName> (<placeName ref="l2786">Kt. Freiburg</placeName>), von <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> und <placeName ref="l160">Freiburg</placeName> gemeinsam verwaltete Vogtei.</note> atque alia loca occupentur misere, a religione et obedientia arceantur atque alia, quae ipse facilius <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>coniecturare poteris quam ego scribere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Proinde te quoque ab <placeName ref="l2448">Antroniis</placeName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Spottname für die katholischen V Orte, vgl. <bibl source="b4">HBBW II</bibl> <ref target="file10110">[Nr. 81]</ref>, S. 88, Anm. 3.</note> aut privatim aut magno silentio interpellatum promiss<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>a t<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ormentorum omnium et signorum restitutione<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Das Gerücht bezieht sich wohl auf die Geschütze und Feldzeichen, die <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> im Zweiten <placeName ref="l242">Kappelerkrieg</placeName> verloren hatte; vgl. <bibl source="b292">HBRG</bibl> III 158f.</note>, quatenus domi maneas et leo me ursinum<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Der Löwe ist <placeName ref="l587">Zürichs</placeName> Wappenhalter, der Bär das Wappentier <placeName ref="l41">Berns</placeName>.</note> nihil penitus curet.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tunc ta<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ndem optatis posse quosdam<pb type="edition" next="93"/> potiri consiliis, ut te connivente et dormiente totus supprimar.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ad hoc, ut audio, tu respon<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>disti te hoc non audere propter agrum tuum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hic velim te ipsum in omnibus membris tuis, quibus fidis, explores, num tale <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quid contigerit aut quid consilii mussitent undique, quo cautius rebus meis providere possim.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nam alioqui, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quantum unquam possum, pacem quaeram nec me intromittam, cum videam etiam <placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> sic omnia agere, ut omnis omnium rerum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et sumptus et iactura in me transferatur, id quod ex comitiis intelliges.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Obsecro itaque te, charissime <persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName>, sic respondeas, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ut quod das, certum sit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Si nihil certum, adde nihil certum, sed ab aliis relatum calamo retulisse.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sic cogor te perpetuo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>obtundere, quandoquidem non solus tibi fido quam optime.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Gaudium ingens nobis foret <placeName ref="l2448">Antroniis</placeName> hoc esse negatum, certissimum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>item argumentum de illorum consilio.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Quicquid ergo hic singulari scriptum numero inveneris, per enallagen aut heterosin <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>intelligas<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">D. h. es geht nicht um <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> und <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, sondern um <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> und <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Non interim dubito, quin a praefecto <persName ref="p8012">Lenczburgico</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8012">Sulpitius Haller</persName>.</note> omnia acceperis, quae desiderasti.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Tuum erit, si <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>me, non diu victurum, videre velis, ad nos venias.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nam ad <placeName ref="l2">Arouw</placeName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><placeName ref="l2">Aarau</placeName> (<placeName ref="l594">Kt. Aargau</placeName>).</note> ego nec pedes nec eques venire valeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Est nuncius ille, olim parochus, nunc apud nos cerdo, affinis <persName ref="p8412">Megandri</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Wohl der unbekannte, aus <placeName ref="l760">Solothurn</placeName> ausgewiesene Pfarrer, der mehrfach als Bote genannt wird; vgl. oben <ref target="file10554">Nr. 518</ref>, Anm. 2.</note>, cui quod negocium hoc attinet, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>literis credere poteris, praeterea ab ore nihil, nisi quod omnibus nobis fuerit commune.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Uno tamen verbo consilium vestrum, si non <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>citius ad nos scripseritis, aperire poteris, quo et quis venturus sit.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Nam non video nos alia ratione melius posse <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>per omnia convenire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, charissime <persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName>, et mei tuis precibus nunquam sis immemor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">9. februarii anno 35.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Tuum <persName ref="p1391">minimum nummisma</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Wortspiel auf <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName>.</note></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>fratri suo charissimo<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
